  "title": "Fury Gold Mines Provides Update on Precautionary Evacuation of Eau Claire Camp Due to Nearby Wildfire - Fury Gold Mines Limited",
  "summary": "All personnel safely evacuated; exploration activities temporarily suspended as a precautionary measure TORONTO, Canada – July 15, 2026 – Fury Gold Mines Limited (TSX and NYSE American: FURY) (“Fury” or the “Company“) today announces that, as a precautionary measure, it has evacuated all personnel from its Eau Claire camp, located in the Eeyou Istchee Territory in the James Bay region […]",
